# The tree is authored with LF endings. Normalize on commit and force LF in the
# working tree on every platform (git auto-detects and leaves binaries alone).
# This keeps the byte-exact spec fixtures under fixtures/ identical on Windows,
# where core.autocrlf would otherwise rewrite them to CRLF and break the codec's
# byte-clean round-trip tests (tests/codec/roundtrip_test.cpp).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt-and-suspenders: the fixtures are byte-exact test vectors — never convert.
fixtures/** -text
